  "design": {
    "idea": "The High Slag Balcony: push the movable Blue color_glass into the vertical gold emitter ray to tint it Blue for the sensor, then steer the X-mirrored mimic_statue across the lava trench around the basalt bump onto the counterweight plate, extending the Cycle 7 bridge straight to kiln_r9 and unlocking ember_6_kiln.",
